---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Design 2 Ink Paper Dark"
  description="Route 02 — Ink Paper Dark. A dark editorial exploration: serif voice, footnotes, and a dated now log."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="r2">
    <div class="r2-page">
      <header class="r2-hero">
        <p class="r2-eyebrow">design exploration 02 / ink paper dark</p>
        <h1 class="r2-name">Abijith Suresh</h1>
        <p class="r2-subline">Backend engineer in Kochi, Kerala. Java and Spring&nbsp;Boot at UST.</p>
        <p class="r2-lede">
          I build server-side systems by day, and spend evenings playing games or
          building small things for the web.<a
            class="r2-fnref"
            href="#r2-fn1"
            id="r2-ref1"
            aria-describedby="r2-footnotes"><sup>1</sup></a
          > Everything here is written plainly, set in one serif voice, and kept
          deliberately quiet.<a
            class="r2-fnref"
            href="#r2-fn2"
            id="r2-ref2"
            aria-describedby="r2-footnotes"><sup>2</sup></a
          >
        </p>
        <ol class="r2-footnotes" id="r2-footnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
          <li id="r2-fn1">
            <span class="r2-fnnum" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <span>Day job: backend engineering with Java and Spring Boot at <a class="r2-link" href="https://ust.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UST</a>. <a class="r2-back" href="#r2-ref1" aria-label="Back to reference 1">Return</a></span>
          </li>
          <li id="r2-fn2">
            <span class="r2-fnnum" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <span>Off hours: games, side projects, and notes. Start with <a class="r2-link" href="/about/">about me</a>. <a class="r2-back" href="#r2-ref2" aria-label="Back to reference 2">Return</a></span>
          </li>
          <li id="r2-fn3">
            <span class="r2-fnnum" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <span>Colophon: set in Fraunces for titles and IBM Plex for everything else. No scripts, no images on this page.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </header>

      <section class="r2-block" aria-labelledby="r2-tools-h">
        <h2 class="r2-h" id="r2-tools-h"><span class="r2-hnum" aria-hidden="true">i.</span> Tools shelf</h2>
        <ul class="r2-shelf">
          <li>
            <a class="r2-itemtitle" href="/skills/">Skills</a>
            <p class="r2-status">Live — what I reach for at work.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="r2-itemtitle" href="/prompts/">Prompts</a>
            <p class="r2-status">Live — saved, reusable working notes.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="r2-itemtitle" aria-disabled="true">Wallpapers</span>
            <p class="r2-status">Future — a small shelf, when it earns its place.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="r2-block" aria-labelledby="r2-work-h">
        <h2 class="r2-h" id="r2-work-h"><span class="r2-hnum" aria-hidden="true">ii.</span> Selected projects</h2>
        <ul class="r2-projects">
          <li>
            <a class="r2-ptitle" href="/projects/#interleaf">Interleaf</a>
            <p class="r2-pdesc">A quiet reading surface. Long-form first, chrome last.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="r2-ptitle" href="/projects/#reshrimp">Reshrimp</a>
            <p class="r2-pdesc">Small utilities that do one job and leave.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="r2-ptitle" href="/projects/#tailory">Tailory</a>
            <p class="r2-pdesc">Cut precisely, finish by hand. Experiments in fit.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="r2-ptitle" href="/projects/#microbreak">Microbreak</a>
            <p class="r2-pdesc">A reminder to stand, stretch, and look away.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="r2-more"><a class="r2-link" href="/projects/">All projects</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="r2-block" aria-labelledby="r2-now-h">
        <h2 class="r2-h" id="r2-now-h"><span class="r2-hnum" aria-hidden="true">iii.</span> Now log</h2>
        <ul class="r2-now">
          <li>
            <span class="r2-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="r2-date" datetime="2026-08-28">2026-08-28</time>
            <span>Shipping backend work at UST; keeping evenings for side builds.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="r2-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="r2-date" datetime="2026-08-14">2026-08-14</time>
            <span>Revising writing drafts and pruning the projects shelf.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="r2-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="r2-date" datetime="2026-07-30">2026-07-30</time>
            <span>Playing through a long game, reading slowly. <a class="r2-link" href="/now/">Full now page</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <nav class="r2-block" aria-label="Elsewhere">
        <h2 class="r2-h"><span class="r2-hnum" aria-hidden="true">iv.</span> Elsewhere</h2>
        <ul class="r2-socials">
          <li><a class="r2-link" href="https://github.com/abijith-suresh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a class="r2-link" href="https://x.com/abijith_sh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a></li>
          <li><a class="r2-link" href="https://linkedin.com/in/abijith-suresh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a class="r2-link" href="https://bsky.app/profile/abijith.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluesky</a></li>
          <li><a class="r2-link" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="r2-index">
          Prefer the index? <a class="r2-link" href="/writing/">Writing</a>, <a class="r2-link" href="/about/">About</a>
        </p>
      </nav>

      <footer class="r2-footer">
        <p>route 02, compare route 01 at <a class="r2-link" href="/1/">/1/</a></p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .r2 {
      --r2-bg: #171310;
      --r2-ink: #ece5d8;
      --r2-muted: #b6ac99;
      --r2-faint: #8f8674;
      --r2-line: #2d261e;
      --r2-green: #a9c795;
      --r2-green-ink: #14210f;
      --r2-serif: "Fraunces", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      flex: 1;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--r2-bg);
      color: var(--r2-ink);
    }
    .r2 ::selection {
      background: var(--r2-green);
      color: var(--r2-green-ink);
    }
    .r2-page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 38rem;
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) 1.5rem 4rem;
    }
    .r2-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: lowercase;
      color: var(--r2-faint);
      margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    }
    .r2-name {
      font-family: var(--r2-serif);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }
    .r2-subline {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--r2-muted);
      margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
      max-width: 32rem;
    }
    .r2-lede {
      font-size: 1.075rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 36rem;
    }
    .r2-fnref {
      color: var(--r2-green);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding-inline: 0.1em;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
    }
    .r2-fnref sup {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72em;
    }
    .r2-footnotes {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
      padding: 1.25rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--r2-line);
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--r2-muted);
    }
    .r2-footnotes li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.5rem 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .r2-fnnum {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--r2-green);
      padding-top: 0.25em;
    }
    .r2-back {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--r2-faint);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .r2-block {
      margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
      padding-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--r2-line);
    }
    .r2-h {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--r2-faint);
      margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    }
    .r2-hnum {
      color: var(--r2-green);
      margin-right: 0.6em;
    }
    .r2-shelf {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .r2-itemtitle {
      font-family: var(--r2-serif);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--r2-ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a.r2-itemtitle {
      background-image: linear-gradient(currentColor, currentColor);
      background-size: 0% 1px;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: left calc(100% - 0px);
      transition: background-size 180ms ease;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }
    .r2-status {
      margin: 0.3rem 0 0;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--r2-faint);
    }
    .r2-projects {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
    }
    .r2-projects li {
      padding: 1.4rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--r2-line);
    }
    .r2-projects li:last-child {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--r2-line);
    }
    .r2-ptitle {
      font-family: var(--r2-serif);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      color: var(--r2-ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      background-image: linear-gradient(currentColor, currentColor);
      background-size: 0% 1px;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: left calc(100% - 1px);
      transition: background-size 180ms ease;
    }
    .r2-pdesc {
      margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--r2-muted);
      max-width: 30rem;
    }
    .r2-more {
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .r2-now {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .r2-now li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.6rem 1fr;
      column-gap: 0.8rem;
      row-gap: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--r2-muted);
    }
    .r2-dot {
      width: 0.5rem;
      height: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 0.55em;
      background: var(--r2-green);
      border-radius: 0.125rem;
    }
    .r2-date {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--r2-ink);
    }
    .r2-now li > span:last-child {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
    .r2-link {
      color: var(--r2-ink);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: var(--r2-green);
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
      background-image: linear-gradient(var(--r2-green), var(--r2-green));
      background-size: 0% 1px;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: left calc(100% + 0px);
      transition: background-size 180ms ease;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
    }
    .r2-socials {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }
    .r2-index {
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--r2-muted);
    }
    .r2-footer {
      margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--r2-line);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--r2-faint);
    }
    .r2-footer p { margin: 0; }
    .r2 a:hover {
      background-size: 100% 1px;
    }
    .r2 a:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--r2-green);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .r2 a {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
